OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker with an afternoon
OL,12,     Fof great music-making -
OL,13,     Fmezzo-soprano Alice Coote and
OL,14,     Fpianist Sergey Rybin live from
OL,15,     FWigmore Hall, plus highlights from
OL,16,     Fthe Edinburgh Festival.
