OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto Kinch returns with another
OL,7,     Fweek of the best in jazz, and he
OL,8,     Fwelcomes Australian
OL,9,     Fmulti-instrumentalist Audrey Powne
OL,10,     Fas his 4/4 guest from Monday to
OL,11,     FThursday.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FThe Polish Radio Choir - Luslawice
OL,14,     Fwith the Polish Radio Orchestra in
OL,15,     FWarsaw, conducted by Michal
OL,16,     FKlauza, perform Brahms's longest
OL,17,     Fcomposition and largest-ensemble
OL,18,     Fwork.
